{"id":"n72134-1-13","stage":3,"title":"추억 · 回忆","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72134-1-13-1","ko":"무슨 생각을 그렇게 골똘히 하세요?","zh":"您在出神地想什么呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：什么","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"2","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"생각을","meaning":"念头，想法","explanation":"생각：念头，想法；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"3","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"골똘히","meaning":"专心地，入迷地","explanation":"골똘히：专心地，入迷地","readings":[{"term":"골똘히","audio":"/audio/26c87fb3b8d2d384780e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18332","senseId":"1","lemma":"골똘히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하세요?","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"虚指，表示不肯定的事物。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"念头，想法","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想做某事的心理或关注；或指那样的事。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"26c87fb3b8d2d384","term":"골똘히","zh":"专心地，入迷地","audio":"/audio/26c87fb3b8d2d384780e.mp3","entryId":"18332","definition":"不想其他事情，高度集中地。","pronunciation":["골똘히"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c30ac8c9fc3491f1fd69.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72134-1-13-2","ko":"가을이 되니 갑자기 추억에 빠지게 되는군.","zh":"一到秋天，就突然变得容易沉浸在回忆里啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가을이","meaning":"秋天，秋季","explanation":"가을：秋天，秋季；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"가을","audio":"/audio/c5911194be78d7d5c393.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32204","senseId":"1","lemma":"가을","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되니","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갑자기","meaning":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","explanation":"갑자기：突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","readings":[{"term":"갑자기","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26797","senseId":"1","lemma":"갑자기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"추억에","meaning":"回忆","explanation":"추억：回忆；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"추억","audio":"/audio/4cd2b5fc382a0a8249e7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72134","senseId":"1","lemma":"추억","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빠지게","meaning":"沉迷，沉浸，坠入","explanation":"빠지다：沉迷，沉浸，坠入；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"빠지다","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71273","senseId":"5","lemma":"빠지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되는군.","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；는군：对新发现或刚得知的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c5911194be78d7d5","term":"가을","zh":"秋天，秋季","audio":"/audio/c5911194be78d7d5c393.mp3","entryId":"32204","definition":"四季中的一个，介于夏天和冬天之间的季节。","pronunciation":["가을"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到；变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"到达某个时间、时期或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"de3915c860a22269","term":"갑자기","zh":"突然，忽然，猛地，一下子","audio":"/audio/de3915c860a22269990f.mp3","entryId":"26797","definition":"来不及想，很快地。","pronunciation":["갑짜기"]},{"id":"4cd2b5fc382a0a82","term":"추억","zh":"回忆","audio":"/audio/4cd2b5fc382a0a8249e7.mp3","entryId":"72134","definition":"想起往事；或指那样的想法或事情。","pronunciation":["추억"]},{"id":"f1cb0821aeeaddd3","term":"빠지다","zh":"沉迷，沉浸，坠入","audio":"/audio/f1cb0821aeeaddd3adf4.mp3","entryId":"71273","definition":"精神过度地倾注于某处。","pronunciation":["빠ː지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/24914b1db136a6decc56.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.08,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72134","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":112,"sequenceScore":2.9067,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["一到秋天，就突然变得容易沉浸在回忆里啊。","您在出神地想什么呢？","那个女人为什么会被警察抓来啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["您在出神地想什么呢？","那个女人为什么会被警察抓来啊？","一到秋天，就突然变得容易沉浸在回忆里啊。"],"answer":2}]}
